@host = http://localhost:5090
@adminKey = local-pilot-only-change-me

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Pilot config
GET {{host}}/api/pilot/config

### Create registration
POST {{host}}/api/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Pilot Participant",
  "email": "pilot@example.com",
  "mobile": "09123456789",
  "municipality": "Loboc, Bohol",
  "organization": "Demo Organization",
  "category": "Individual",
  "participation": "Bamboo commitment",
  "bambooUnits": 2,
  "notes": "Static QR pilot"
}

### Admin dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/admin/dashboard
X-Pilot-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Admin registrations
GET {{host}}/api/admin/registrations
X-Pilot-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}
